"A signed-in user can choose to synchronize custom sound files and their\n      names and settings. XTimers stores those files with the user's account so\n      they are available on the user's other devices." = "Prijavljeni uporabnik lahko izbere sinhronizacijo zvočnih datotek po meri ter njihovih imen in nastavitev. XTimers te datoteke shrani v uporabnikov račun, da so na voljo v njegovih drugih napravah.";
"A signed-in user can delete one connected XTimers account. This removes\n      that account's active timer, snapshot, sound, feedback, reminder, message,\n      SMS configuration, and push-registration data from the XTimers service.\n      The Xin Account, shared sign-in identity, and any other connected product\n      accounts remain available." = "Prijavljeni uporabnik lahko izbriše en povezan račun XTimers. S tem se iz storitve XTimers odstranijo podatki aktivnega časovnika, posnetkov, zvokov, povratnih informacij, opomnikov, sporočil, nastavitev SMS in registracije potisnih obvestil tega računa. Xin Account, skupna identiteta za prijavo in vsi drugi povezani računi izdelkov ostanejo na voljo.";
"A user can separately delete the global Xin Account. The confirmation\n      identifies every connected product to be deleted. Xintech LLC first\n      completes deletion of those connected product accounts, including\n      XTimers data, and then deletes the shared Xin Account identity,\n      authentication and session records, linked-provider records, and active\n      recovery records. An unfinished or zero-product Xin identity can be\n      deleted without deleting XTimers data because no XTimers account is\n      connected to it." = "Uporabnik lahko ločeno izbriše globalni Xin Account. V potrditvi je naveden vsak povezani izdelek, ki bo izbrisan. Xintech LLC najprej dokonča izbris teh povezanih računov izdelkov, vključno s podatki XTimers, nato pa izbriše skupno identiteto Xin Account, zapise za preverjanje pristnosti in seje, zapise povezanih ponudnikov prijave ter aktivne zapise za obnovitev. Nedokončano identiteto Xin ali identiteto brez izdelkov je mogoče izbrisati brez brisanja podatkov XTimers, ker z njo ni povezan noben račun XTimers.";
"After the phone is verified and opted in, the user may schedule reminder SMS\n        only to that same verified, opted-in account phone number." = "Ko je telefonska številka preverjena in je uporabnik podal soglasje, lahko SMS-opomnike načrtuje samo na isto preverjeno telefonsko številko računa, za katero je podal soglasje.";
