"Understand feature use and improve reliability and performance." = "Razumevanje uporabe funkcij ter izboljševanje zanesljivosti in učinkovitosti.";
"Use XTimers product support for timers, synchronization, reports, sounds,\n      reminders, alarms, XTimers account membership, or deletion of XTimers data\n      while keeping Xin Account. Include the app platform and version, but do\n      not email a password, security code, session token, or recovery\n      credential." = "Podporo za izdelek XTimers uporabite za časovnike, sinhronizacijo, poročila, zvoke, opomnike, alarme, članstvo računa XTimers ali izbris podatkov XTimers ob ohranitvi Xin Account. Navedite platformo in različico aplikacije, vendar po e-pošti ne pošiljajte gesla, varnostne kode, žetona seje ali poverilnice za obnovitev.";
"Use Xin Account support for shared sign-in, account-email access,\n      security or recovery questions, linked sign-in providers, sessions, an\n      unfinished signup, or deletion of the global Xin Account. Deleting Xin\n      Account also deletes every connected product listed in the confirmation." = "Podporo Xin Account uporabite za skupno prijavo, dostop do e-pošte računa, vprašanja o varnosti ali obnovitvi, povezane ponudnike prijave, seje, nedokončano registracijo ali izbris globalnega Xin Account. Z izbrisom Xin Account se izbriše tudi vsak povezani izdelek, naveden v potrditvi.";
"Use bundled sounds, custom sounds, beeps, and local notifications." = "Uporabljajte priložene zvoke, zvoke po meri, piske in lokalna obvestila.";
"User affirmatively checks the SMS consent checkbox." = "Uporabnik izrecno označi potrditveno polje za soglasje za SMS.";
"User can open the SMS Terms and Privacy Policy links from the same screen." = "Uporabnik lahko na istem zaslonu odpre povezavi do Pogojev za SMS in Pravilnika o zasebnosti.";
"User clicks Continue to request a one-time verification code." = "Uporabnik klikne Nadaljuj, da zahteva enkratno kodo za preverjanje.";
"User enters their own phone number." = "Uporabnik vnese svojo telefonsko številko.";
"User opens Account Info." = "Uporabnik odpre Podatke o računu.";
"User opens Set Up SMS." = "Uporabnik odpre Nastavi SMS.";
"User signs in to Flexible Timers." = "Uporabnik se prijavi v Flexible Timers.";
"Users can manage synchronization and activity-tracking features in the\n      app, sign out, remove local data from a device, delete XTimers data while\n      keeping Xin Account, delete the global Xin Account and every listed\n      product, and opt out of SMS by replying STOP. See the" = "Uporabniki lahko v aplikaciji upravljajo funkcije sinhronizacije in spremljanja dejavnosti, se odjavijo, odstranijo lokalne podatke iz naprave, izbrišejo podatke XTimers ob ohranitvi Xin Account, izbrišejo globalni Xin Account in vsak navedeni izdelek ter se odjavijo od SMS z odgovorom STOP. Oglejte si";
"Users may submit feedback anonymously or choose to attach it to their\n      signed-in account. XTimers stores the feedback text and operational\n      metadata needed to review the request, prevent abuse, and respond or fix\n      problems. Anonymous feedback is not attached to an account identifier,\n      although ordinary network request metadata may still be recorded." = "Uporabniki lahko povratne informacije pošljejo anonimno ali jih povežejo s prijavljenim računom. XTimers shrani besedilo povratnih informacij in operativne metapodatke, potrebne za pregled zahteve, preprečevanje zlorab ter odgovor ali odpravo težav. Anonimne povratne informacije niso povezane z identifikatorjem računa, vendar se običajni metapodatki omrežne zahteve lahko še vedno zabeležijo.";
"Users opt in inside the Flexible Timers app by entering their phone number\n      and affirmatively checking a box that is not pre-selected. The checkbox\n      says: \"I agree to receive SMS verification codes and reminder messages\n      from Flexible Timers by Xintech LLC that I schedule for myself at this\n      phone number.\" The opt-in screen also displays these SMS Terms, the\n      Privacy Policy, standard message and data rate disclosure, STOP and HELP\n      instructions, message frequency information, and no-marketing language.\n      Consent is not a condition of purchase.\n      See the opt-in evidence page at" = "Uporabniki se v aplikaciji Flexible Timers prijavijo tako, da vnesejo svojo telefonsko številko in izrecno označijo potrditveno polje, ki ni vnaprej izbrano. Besedilo polja se glasi: \"Soglašam, da na to telefonsko številko prejemam kode za preverjanje SMS in opomnike aplikacije Flexible Timers družbe Xintech LLC, ki jih načrtujem zase.\" Zaslon za prijavo prikazuje tudi te Pogoje za SMS, Pravilnik o zasebnosti, razkritje običajnih cen sporočil in prenosa podatkov, navodila STOP in HELP, podatke o pogostosti sporočil ter besedilo, da tržnih sporočil ni. Soglasje ni pogoj za nakup. Glejte stran z dokazilom o prijavi na";
"Website Analytics" = "Analitika spletnega mesta";
"When a user connects XTimers to a Xin Account, XTimers processes a\n      separate XTimers account identifier, its Xin Account association, product\n      settings, and the contact email used for requested XTimers messages. When\n      the user enables SMS features, XTimers also processes a verified phone\n      number and SMS consent records. XTimers uses this product information to\n      synchronize XTimers data, deliver requested messages, prevent abuse, and\n      provide XTimers product support." = "Ko uporabnik poveže XTimers z Xin Account, XTimers obdeluje ločen identifikator računa XTimers, njegovo povezavo z Xin Account, nastavitve izdelka in kontaktni e-poštni naslov za zahtevana sporočila XTimers. Ko uporabnik omogoči funkcije SMS, XTimers obdeluje tudi preverjeno telefonsko številko in zapise o soglasju za SMS. XTimers te podatke o izdelku uporablja za sinhronizacijo podatkov XTimers, dostavo zahtevanih sporočil, preprečevanje zlorab in zagotavljanje podpore za izdelek XTimers.";
"When the user enables automatic activity tracking, XTimers records\n      application activity on the user's Mac. Website-hostname tracking is\n      available only in the separately distributed XTimers Pro edition\n      (downloaded from xintechllc.com, not the App Store); it never applies to\n      the App Store edition. The underlying activity log is maintained on the\n      device and is not continuously uploaded. If the user explicitly emails or\n      publishes an activity report, the selected report content, including\n      application names (and, in XTimers Pro, website hostnames) shown in that\n      report, is sent to XTimers' service to perform the requested action." = "Ko uporabnik omogoči samodejno spremljanje dejavnosti, XTimers beleži dejavnost aplikacij v uporabnikovem računalniku Mac. Spremljanje imen gostiteljev spletnih mest je na voljo samo v ločeno distribuirani izdaji XTimers Pro (preneseni z xintechllc.com, ne iz trgovine App Store) in nikoli ne velja za izdajo iz trgovine App Store. Osnovni dnevnik dejavnosti se hrani v napravi in se ne nalaga neprekinjeno. Če uporabnik izrecno pošlje poročilo o dejavnosti po e-pošti ali ga objavi, se izbrana vsebina poročila, vključno z imeni aplikacij (in v XTimers Pro imeni gostiteljev spletnih mest), prikazanimi v poročilu, pošlje storitvi XTimers za izvedbo zahtevanega dejanja.";
"When the user turns on the Personal Calendar Overlay and grants permission,\n      XTimers reads events from the calendars the user selects in Apple Calendar,\n      including any iCloud, Google, Outlook, or subscribed calendars already\n      configured there. XTimers does not connect to those calendar providers\n      directly and never requests their account credentials; Apple Calendar\n      continues to synchronize them under the user's own settings.\n      Event details are read on the device to display them and are not uploaded\n      to XTimers' service. XTimers stores only the user's on/off choice, the\n      identifiers of the calendars selected on that installation, and a record\n      of which privacy explanation was acknowledged. XTimers never creates,\n      edits, or deletes events in the user's calendars." = "Ko uporabnik vklopi prekrivanje osebnega koledarja in podeli dovoljenje, XTimers bere dogodke iz koledarjev, ki jih uporabnik izbere v aplikaciji Koledar, vključno z vsemi koledarji iCloud, Google, Outlook ali naročenimi koledarji, ki so tam že nastavljeni. XTimers se s temi ponudniki koledarjev ne povezuje neposredno in nikoli ne zahteva poverilnic za njihove račune; aplikacija Koledar jih še naprej sinhronizira v skladu z uporabnikovimi nastavitvami. Podrobnosti dogodkov se za prikaz preberejo v napravi in se ne naložijo v storitev XTimers. XTimers shrani samo uporabnikovo izbiro vklopa ali izklopa, identifikatorje koledarjev, izbranih v tej namestitvi, in zapis o tem, katera različica pojasnila o zasebnosti je bila potrjena. XTimers nikoli ne ustvarja, ureja ali briše dogodkov v uporabnikovih koledarjih.";
"Wireless carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages." = "Brezžični operaterji ne odgovarjajo za zakasnjena ali nedostavljena sporočila.";
"XTimers" = "XTimers";
"XTimers Messaging Help" = "Pomoč pri sporočilih XTimers";
"XTimers Privacy Choices" = "Izbira možnosti zasebnosti XTimers";
"XTimers Product and Contact Information" = "Informacije o izdelku XTimers in kontaktni podatki";
"XTimers Product and Data Support" = "Podpora za izdelek in podatke XTimers";
"XTimers Support" = "Podpora XTimers";
"XTimers and Xin Account are operated by Xintech LLC. For identity,\n      recovery, product, deletion, or SMS support, email us at" = "XTimers in Xin Account upravlja Xintech LLC. Za podporo glede identitete, obnovitve, izdelka, izbrisa ali SMS nam pišite na";
"XTimers app screenshots" = "Posnetki zaslona aplikacije XTimers";
"XTimers by Xintech LLC Privacy Policy" = "Pravilnik o zasebnosti XTimers družbe Xintech LLC";
"XTimers by Xintech LLC SMS is limited to account phone\n      verification codes and user-created reminder SMS sent only to the\n      signed-in user's own verified, opted-in account phone number. Reply STOP\n      to opt out of SMS messages. Reply HELP for help. Reply START or YES to\n      opt back in after consenting in the app. SMS is not a two-way chat\n      service." = "SMS aplikacije XTimers družbe Xintech LLC je omejen na kode za preverjanje telefonske številke računa in SMS-opomnike, ki jih ustvari uporabnik ter se pošljejo samo na lastno preverjeno telefonsko številko računa prijavljenega uporabnika, za katero je podal soglasje. Za odjavo od SMS-ov odgovorite STOP. Za pomoč odgovorite HELP. Za ponovno prijavo po podaji soglasja v aplikaciji odgovorite START ali YES. SMS ni storitev dvosmernega klepeta.";
"XTimers currently sends email reports, verification messages, and\n      user-created reminders only to the signed-in user's own Xin Account email\n      address. SMS is sent only to the user's own verified, opted-in account\n      phone number. XTimers may process message content, delivery status,\n      scheduled time, and provider response metadata to deliver and troubleshoot\n      these messages." = "XTimers trenutno pošilja e-poštna poročila, potrditvena sporočila in opomnike, ki jih ustvari uporabnik, samo na lastni e-poštni naslov Xin Account prijavljenega uporabnika. SMS se pošiljajo samo na uporabnikovo lastno preverjeno telefonsko številko s soglasjem. XTimers lahko za dostavo in odpravljanje težav s temi sporočili obdeluje vsebino sporočila, stanje dostave, načrtovani čas in metapodatke odgovora ponudnika.";
"XTimers does not use the collected app data to track users across apps or\n      websites owned by other companies for advertising. Xintech LLC does not\n      sell SMS opt-in data or other app data. Xintech LLC does not share SMS\n      opt-in data, phone numbers, or text-message consent with third parties or\n      affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes." = "XTimers zbranih podatkov aplikacije ne uporablja za oglaševalsko spremljanje uporabnikov med aplikacijami ali spletnimi mesti v lasti drugih podjetij. Xintech LLC ne prodaja podatkov o prijavi na SMS ali drugih podatkov aplikacije. Xintech LLC podatkov o prijavi na SMS, telefonskih številk ali soglasja za besedilna sporočila ne deli s tretjimi osebami ali povezanimi družbami za tržne ali promocijske namene.";
"XTimers email reports and email messages are currently limited to the\n      signed-in user's own Xin Account email address." = "E-poštna poročila in e-poštna sporočila XTimers so trenutno omejena na lastni e-poštni naslov Xin Account prijavljenega uporabnika.";
"XTimers for Mac" = "XTimers za Mac";
"XTimers home" = "Domača stran XTimers";
"XTimers iPad screenshot" = "Posnetek zaslona aplikacije XTimers v iPadu";
"XTimers iPad timer list in light mode" = "Seznam časovnikov XTimers za iPad v svetlem načinu";
"XTimers iPhone screenshot" = "Posnetek zaslona aplikacije XTimers v iPhonu";
"XTimers iPhone timer list in light mode" = "Seznam časovnikov XTimers za iPhone v svetlem načinu";
"XTimers is a calm Apple-native timer workspace for timers, countdowns, clocks, task sets, reports, custom sounds, and account reminders across Mac, iPhone, and iPad." = "XTimers je umirjeno, Applovim platformam prilagojeno delovno okolje za časovnike, odštevalnike, ure, nabore opravil, poročila, zvoke po meri in opomnike računa v računalnikih Mac, iPhonih in iPadih.";
"XTimers is operated by Xintech LLC and uses Xin Account for shared\n      sign-in. This policy explains the information processed for Xin Account\n      identity services and for XTimers timers, countdowns, activity tracking,\n      synchronization, reports, custom sounds, reminders, support, and\n      messaging features." = "XTimers upravlja Xintech LLC in za skupno prijavo uporablja Xin Account. Ta pravilnik pojasnjuje informacije, obdelane za identitetne storitve Xin Account ter za časovnike, odštevanja, spremljanje dejavnosti, sinhronizacijo, poročila, zvoke po meri, opomnike, podporo in funkcije sporočanja XTimers.";
"XTimers macOS add countdown sheet in light mode" = "List za dodajanje odštevalnika XTimers v sistemu macOS v svetlem načinu";
"XTimers macOS add timer sheet in light mode" = "List za dodajanje časovnika XTimers v sistemu macOS v svetlem načinu";
"XTimers macOS expanded double-column timer window" = "Razširjeno dvostolpčno okno časovnika XTimers v sistemu macOS";
"XTimers macOS main timer window in light mode" = "Glavno okno časovnika XTimers v sistemu macOS v svetlem načinu";
"XTimers may process a per-installation device identifier, push-notification\n      token, platform, app version, build number, operating-system version,\n      device model, service command or feature interaction, response status,\n      response duration, and error information. These records are used to\n      provide synchronization and notifications, operate the service, measure\n      feature use, diagnose failures, improve performance, and prevent abuse." = "XTimers lahko obdeluje identifikator naprave za posamezno namestitev, žeton za potisna obvestila, platformo, različico aplikacije, številko gradnje, različico operacijskega sistema, model naprave, ukaz storitve ali interakcijo s funkcijo, stanje in trajanje odgovora ter podatke o napakah. Ti zapisi se uporabljajo za zagotavljanje sinhronizacije in obvestil, delovanje storitve, merjenje uporabe funkcij, diagnosticiranje napak, izboljševanje učinkovitosti in preprečevanje zlorab.";
"XTimers platforms" = "Platforme XTimers";
"XTimers receives the IP address and user-agent information used to connect\n      to its service. For security, troubleshooting, abuse prevention, and\n      service administration, the service may retain the IP address, a derived\n      IP key, approximate country, region, city, postal area, network\n      organization, request time, command name, and a stable hashed account\n      identifier for authenticated requests. The app also submits Apple\n      MetricKit diagnostic payloads that can contain crash, hang, CPU, disk,\n      energy, and other performance or technical information." = "XTimers prejme naslov IP in podatke uporabniškega agenta, uporabljene za povezavo s storitvijo. Zaradi varnosti, odpravljanja težav, preprečevanja zlorab in upravljanja storitve lahko ta hrani naslov IP, izpeljani ključ IP, približno državo, regijo, mesto, poštno območje, omrežno organizacijo, čas zahteve, ime ukaza in stabilni zgoščeni identifikator računa za overjene zahteve. Aplikacija pošilja tudi diagnostične podatke Apple MetricKit, ki lahko vsebujejo podatke o zrušitvah, zastojih, CPE-ju, disku, energiji in druge podatke o učinkovitosti ali tehnične podatke.";
"XTimers uses a Xin Account to identify and authenticate a user. A Xin\n      Account is the shared identity layer for XTimers and any other connected\n      products listed in the account controls; it is not an XTimers product\n      account and does not contain XTimers timers, reports, sounds, or SMS data." = "XTimers uporablja Xin Account za identifikacijo in preverjanje pristnosti uporabnika. Xin Account je skupna identitetna plast za XTimers in vse druge povezane izdelke, navedene v kontrolnikih računa; ni račun izdelka XTimers in ne vsebuje časovnikov, poročil, zvokov ali podatkov SMS XTimers.";
"XTimers uses your Xin Account for shared sign-in while XTimers keeps your timers, reports, settings, sounds, and SMS choices as XTimers product data." = "XTimers uporablja vaš Xin Account za skupno prijavo, medtem ko XTimers vaše časovnike, poročila, nastavitve, zvoke in izbire SMS hrani kot podatke izdelka XTimers.";
"XTimers — Mac, iPhone, and iPad" = "XTimers — Mac, iPhone in iPad";
"Xin Account Identity and Recovery" = "Identiteta in obnovitev Xin Account";
"Xin Account Identity and Sign-In" = "Identiteta in prijava Xin Account";
"Xin Account identity data is retained while needed to provide the shared\n      identity and connected-product associations. XTimers product data is\n      retained while needed to provide the connected XTimers account and its\n      requested features. Published report content is unavailable after its\n      selected expiration and is removed by service cleanup. Message and\n      consent records may be retained as needed for delivery, troubleshooting,\n      abuse prevention, and carrier or legal compliance." = "Podatki identitete Xin Account se hranijo, dokler so potrebni za zagotavljanje skupne identitete in povezav s povezanimi izdelki. Podatki izdelka XTimers se hranijo, dokler so potrebni za zagotavljanje povezanega računa XTimers in zahtevanih funkcij. Objavljena vsebina poročila po izbranem poteku ni več na voljo in jo odstrani čiščenje storitve. Zapisi sporočil in soglasij se lahko hranijo, kolikor je potrebno za dostavo, odpravljanje težav, preprečevanje zlorab ter skladnost z zahtevami operaterjev ali zakonodaje.";
"Xin Account processes an account identifier, email address,\n      authentication and session records, linked sign-in provider records,\n      recovery and security records, account lifecycle records, and the\n      association between the Xin Account and each connected product account.\n      Xintech LLC uses this information to authenticate the user, secure and\n      recover the account, manage sessions and linked providers, authorize\n      connected-product access, prevent abuse, and provide identity support." = "Xin Account obdeluje identifikator računa, e-poštni naslov, zapise za preverjanje pristnosti in seje, zapise povezanih ponudnikov prijave, zapise za obnovitev in varnost, zapise življenjskega cikla računa ter povezavo med Xin Account in vsakim povezanim računom izdelka. Xintech LLC te informacije uporablja za preverjanje pristnosti uporabnika, zaščito in obnovitev računa, upravljanje sej in povezanih ponudnikov, odobritev dostopa do povezanih izdelkov, preprečevanje zlorab in zagotavljanje podpore za identiteto.";
"Xin Account sign-in. XTimers data stays separate." = "Prijava z Xin Account. Podatki XTimers ostanejo ločeni.";
"Xintech LLC uses administrative, technical, and organizational measures\n      intended to protect XTimers information. No storage or transmission system\n      can be guaranteed to be completely secure." = "Xintech LLC uporablja upravne, tehnične in organizacijske ukrepe, namenjene zaščiti podatkov XTimers. Za noben sistem shranjevanja ali prenosa ni mogoče zagotoviti popolne varnosti.";
"Xintech LLC uses service providers for identity and authentication, cloud\n      hosting and storage, email and SMS delivery, push notifications,\n      diagnostics, and website analytics. These providers may process\n      information only as needed to perform services for Xintech LLC, subject\n      to their applicable terms and privacy safeguards. Email and SMS providers\n      receive the recipient, requested message content, and delivery metadata\n      needed to send the user's message." = "Xintech LLC uporablja ponudnike storitev za identiteto in preverjanje pristnosti, gostovanje in shranjevanje v oblaku, dostavo e-pošte in SMS, potisna obvestila, diagnostiko ter spletno analitiko. Ti ponudniki lahko obdelujejo informacije samo v obsegu, potrebnem za opravljanje storitev za Xintech LLC, in v skladu z veljavnimi pogoji ter varovali zasebnosti. Ponudniki e-pošte in SMS prejmejo podatke o prejemniku, zahtevano vsebino sporočila in metapodatke dostave, potrebne za pošiljanje uporabnikovega sporočila.";
"Your Xin Account identifies you and authorizes each connected XTimers account." = "Xin Account vas identificira in odobri vsak povezan račun XTimers.";
